ce! Customize your troops with powerful weapons, crafted gear, and inspiring banners to turn the tide of battle against hordes of monsters.","steam_appid":3807560,"support_info":{"email":"tofugameph@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}